{"id":"7dd3434f494dba6e","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-ax-ext.md","title":"Axiom of Extensionality","display":"ax-ext — Axiom of Extensionality","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-ax-ext","aliases":["58-ax-ext"],"display":"ax-ext — Axiom of Extensionality","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-ax-ext"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-ax-ext</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-ext — Axiom of Extensionality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,x\">\\(A,B,x\\)</span>（集合变量）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span>（集合论一阶语言的二元隶属关系符号）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}ext}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\,\\forall B\\;\\left(\\forall x\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow x\\in B)\\to A=B\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}ext}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\,\\forall B\\;\\left(\\forall x\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow x\\in B)\\to A=B\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>外延公理断言集合完全由其元素决定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span> 蕴含同元素的反向方向来自一阶逻辑的等号替换规则。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,x","display":false},{"tex":"\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}ext}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\,\\forall B\\;\\left(\\forall x\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow x\\in B)\\to A=B\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"A=B","display":false}],"bytes":589,"backlinks":[{"id":"1a1bd99dd7ad94ea","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0c784c857687fd14","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"从右向左使用 [[58-ax-ext]]；从左向右使用一阶等号的替换规则。"},{"id":"da27abf5af2ad534","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0b8de0824384672e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-ax-ext.md|58-ax-ext]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":[]}